# 4. RUMUS REWARD SETELAH CLEAR

| Reward        | Clear Pertama | Clear Berikutnya |
| ------------- | ------------: | ---------------: |
| Gold          |          100% |              25% |
| Gems          |          100% |              25% |
| Ticket Normal |       1 tiket |       1% peluang |
| Ticket Major  |       2 tiket |       1% peluang |
| Ticket Final  |       2 tiket |       1% peluang |

Contoh lantai 50:

```text
Hadiah Dasar:
Gold = 12,500
Gems = 250
Ticket = 2
```

Clear pertama:

```text
Gold = 12,500
Gems = 250
Ticket = 2
```

Clear berikutnya:

```text
Gold = 12,500 × 25% = 3,125
Gems = 250 × 25% = 62
Ticket = 1% peluang mendapatkan 1 tiket
```

Pembulatan Gems menggunakan pembulatan ke bawah:

```text
250 × 25% = 62.5
Gems yang diberikan = 62
```

