# 17. REWARD LOGIC

## 17.1 Menentukan Status Clear

```text
IF floorClearStatus == false
    clearStatus = UNCLEARED
ELSE
    clearStatus = CLEARED
```

## 17.2 Menghitung Gold dan Gems

```text
IF clearStatus == UNCLEARED
    Gold = baseGold
    Gems = baseGems
ELSE
    Gold = floor(baseGold * 0.25)
    Gems = floor(baseGems * 0.25)
```

## 17.3 Menentukan Ticket

```text
IF clearStatus == UNCLEARED
    IF floor % 5 == 0
        Ticket = 2
    ELSE
        Ticket = 1
ELSE
    IF random(0.0, 1.0) < 0.01
        Ticket = 1
    ELSE
        Ticket = 0
```

## 17.4 Menentukan Reward Type

```text
IF floor == 100
    TYPE = FINAL

ELSE IF floor % 5 == 0
    TYPE = MAJOR

ELSE
    TYPE = NORMAL
```

